Melee Attack
Requires: Berserker Rank 1
| 4 SN | +2 ACC | +1 DMG |
Effect:
If this attack kills or incapacitates your target, gain an additional movement action and repeat it at no Strain cost. Breakthrough can only be repeated like this once per round.
               *     |     Rooted Blows
Utility
Requires: Berserker Rank 2
| 4 SN |
Effect:
Lose your movement action for this turn. Breakthrough can repeat twice upon incapacitating or killing a target this round.


