Passive
Requires: Legionary Rank 0
Effect:
Heal 2 Strain whenever you use a consumable item or perform an attack with a weapon you have equipped since the beginning of your previous turn. Suffer 6 Strain whenever you witness an ally being reduced to 0 HP.
               *   >>   Tactical Breach
Utility
Requires: Legionary Rank 1
| 6 SN |
Effect:
You may freely holster any weapons and items and suffer -4 EVA until your next turn. Perform a +2 ACC attack using a newly equipped weapon or consumable that heals 2 Strain of all allies with half or more of their SL if successful.
               *   >>   Solid Formation
Defensive
Requires: Legionary Rank 2
| 0 SN | +3 EVA |
Effect:
You and all allies that are in your A or are also adjacent to these allies are considered a part of your formation and cannot be flanked. Until your next turn allies in your formation gain +1 EVA and you suffer 1 Strain whenever they are damaged.
