Defensive
Requires: Protean Rank 2
| 4 SN | +0 EVA |
Effect:
If you are not damaged until your next turn, heal 8 SN down to half of your max SL. Otherwise, gain 3 temporary destiny points that last until the end of the combat encounter and increase one of your Failings by 1 rank.
