Comfort Aspects
	Requirements
	Wider Box
You have been focusing your attention towards creative problem solving for so long that your regular thought process got upgraded with several of the useful methods you like to apply. This certainly provides you with many paths towards resolving any given problem, but turning your attention towards these options sometimes leaves you unable to recall how to find new ones.


[+] You may have 8 discipline abilities active at once
[-] Using inactive abilities costs 2 destiny points
	• Spend 3 destiny points on using abilities you have learned which are inactive
	Cold Steel Shell
Your enemy is staring deep into your soul, weapon in hand, ready to blow apart your fragile vessel. As it is about to hit you, your metallic prosthetic arm budges involuntarily, placing itself to absorb the blow. It bends and screeches, disconnects from your shoulder and falls, yet it takes the weapon with it. Your destructive, artificial body takes this chance to enact retribution.


[+] You may exert your artificial body parts to gain a Destiny Point for any roll or negate up to 4 DMG. When you do this, perform a CL 18 Engineering check which damages the body part on failure.
	• Installed prosthetic Limb
	

	

	

	

