Tactics Aspects
	Requirements
	Horde Slayer
Great weapons excel not at killing great enemies, but at allowing a great wielder to slay countless hordes of lesser foes.


[+] Once per combat encounter, whenever you kill or incapacitate a target with an attack that hit another enemy gain 1 temporary destiny point that lasts until the end of the encounter
	• Class Rank 1
	Exemplary Combatant
Blow by blow, cut by cut, your foes crumble under your sequential onslaught.


[+] Once per combat encounter, whenever you kill or incapacitate a target you have damaged 3 times gain 1 temporary destiny point that lasts until the end of the encounter
	• Class Rank 1
	Opportune Lurker
The moment you enter combat often becomes both the true beginning of the battle and its practical end.


[+] Once per combat encounter, whenever you kill or incapacitate a target from full VG in a single attack, gain 1 temporary destiny point that lasts until the end of the encounter
	• Class Rank 1
	Beating Heart
Everyone makes a mistake at some point, and in mortal combat blood is the only valid currency. You are there to pump it back into their veins when they finally run out.


[+] Once per combat encounter, when you perform an ability that interacts with an ally two times gain 1 temporary destiny point that lasts until the end of the encounter
	• Class Rank 1
	________________




Tactics Aspects
	Requirements
	Merciless Bombardier
You do not relate to the savage principles of respect and honor - guile and precision are the only qualities you require to rain fury upon your foes.


[+] Once per combat encounter, when you kill or incapacitate a target with 2 or more ranged attacks gain 1 temporary destiny point that lasts until the end of the encounter
	• Class Rank 1
	Radiant Conduit
While the warriors clash and fall you take a step back in an attempt to solve the puzzle before you. When you finally do, everyone else will fall.


[+] Once per combat encounter, when you use an ability with a conviction requirement three times gain 1 temporary destiny point that lasts until the end of the encounter
	• Class Rank 1
	Master Tactician
Force is worthless without a pointed mind guiding it, and you take that heavy burden upon yourself in a desperate attempt to save them all.


[+] Once per combat encounter, when you suffer a total of 10 SN on non-attack abilities gain 1 temporary destiny point that lasts until the end of the encounter
	• Class Rank 1
	Living Bulwark
When all else fails and doubt clouds your mind, you are there to provide moments of reprieve and hope to those your body shields.


[+] Once per combat encounter, when you are reduced to half or less of your maximum VG gain 1 temporary destiny point that lasts until the end of the encounter
	• Class Rank 1
