Eidoloscopes are specialized tools capable of interfacing with memory-holding ambedic shards and sentient minds. While simply delving into memories contained within shards is a relatively simple procedure that requires basic eidoloscope models, interfacing with live memories or even warping them requires the implantation of ambedic prosthetics. This enables the user to form a stronger mental connection to the subject and more effortlessly interface with the data presented. The medical procedures required to install these implants are difficult and risky, requiring highly skilled and professional surgeons. The vast majority of these individuals are trained in Eterion.
