Focuses are modular trinkets that channel the power of the seasons into specific performable abilities. While you can perform rank 0 seasonal abilities without a focus, having one is essential for all further ranks of abilities. Each focus also has 2 modification slots which will increase the rank of available abilities by 1 per modification added.
________________
Modifications
Experienced fighters often settle into their own unique style of combat and begin to tinker with their equipment to make it truly their own. Modifications are small improvements or trade-offs that can be applied to weapons to alter them and further specialize their usage. Most weapons can support a single modification, with focuses and instruments being able to support two.


