	Advanced Concoctions
Advanced concoctions require rarer ingredients and a larger number of resources and time to brew. They are split into multiple categories based on their use. Tonics offer long-lasting buffs to physical and mental performance. Elixirs offer very potent but short-lived bursts of proficiency. Advanced poisons often come with debilitating side effects. Remedies offer an efficient solution to deal with suffered injuries.


